# Optional — leave unset for normal local dev (npm run dev:web + npm run dev:server).
# The frontend defaults to same-origin, relying on the Vite dev-server proxy (see
# vite.config.ts) to forward /api, /ws, /pty, /gemini-proxy to the backend. Only set this
# if the frontend and backend are served from genuinely different origins with no proxy
# in front of them (e.g. a split production deployment).
# VITE_SERVER_URL=https://your-backend-host.example.com
